%% Sequence Flow 3 — Sandboxed Code Execution & AI Code Review

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Candidate as User / Candidate
    participant SPA as React Frontend
    participant API as NestJS Coding API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant Redis as Redis and BullMQ
    participant Worker as Coding Worker
    participant Piston as Piston Sandbox

    Candidate->>SPA: Clicks "Run Code"
    SPA->>API: POST /coding/session/:sessionId/run
    API->>PG: Insert CodingExecution(status: queued)
    API->>Redis: Enqueue coding-execution job
    API-->>SPA: HTTP 202 { executionId, status: queued }

    Worker->>PG: Update execution(status: running)
    Worker->>Piston: Execute code against examples
    Note over Piston: Untrusted code runs in the bounded Piston sandbox
    Piston-->>Worker: Test results and metrics
    Worker->>PG: Persist result and mark execution completed

    Candidate->>SPA: Poll execution status
    SPA->>API: GET /coding/session/:sessionId/executions/:executionId
    API->>PG: Read by executionId + sessionId + userId
    PG-->>API: Persisted status and result
    API-->>SPA: HTTP 200 { status, result }

    Candidate->>SPA: Clicks "Submit Solution"
    SPA->>API: POST /coding/session/:sessionId/submit
    API->>Redis: Reserve daily solve quota
    API->>PG: Insert CodingExecution(operation: submit)
    API->>Redis: Enqueue coding-execution job
    API-->>SPA: HTTP 202 { executionId, status: queued }
    Worker->>Piston: Execute submitted solution
    Worker->>PG: Transactionally persist result, answer, and session counters
    Worker->>Redis: Finalize or release solve quota

    Note over Candidate,PG: AI code review remains deferred
